    "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Forms · MCQ Form Builder</title>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/assets/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:wght@500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Noto+Sans+Devanagari:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"bar\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#181614\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fffffd\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#4078e8\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"7.3\" width=\"6\" height=\"1.4\" rx=\".7\" fill=\"#fffffd\"/><rect x=\"11\" y=\"13.3\" width=\"6\" height=\"1.4\" rx=\".7\" fill=\"#fffffd\"/></svg>\n      MCQ Form Builder\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"who\">\n      <img id=\"avatar\" alt=\"\" hidden referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n      <span class=\"email\" id=\"email\"></span>\n      <button class=\"link\" id=\"logout\" type=\"button\">Sign out</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"forms-h\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <h1 id=\"forms-h\">Your forms.<span class=\"soft\" id=\"forms-soft\">Loading...</span></h1>\n      <div class=\"summary\" id=\"summary\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"warnbar\" id=\"warn\" hidden></div>\n    <div class=\"toolbar\">\n      <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Show\">\n        <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-all\" aria-selected=\"true\" type=\"button\">All</button>\n        <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-created\" aria-selected=\"false\" type=\"button\">Made</button>\n        <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-failed\" aria-selected=\"false\" type=\"button\">Failed</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <span class=\"tool-status\" id=\"refresh-status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-grey\" id=\"refresh\" type=\"button\">Refresh response counts</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"list\" id=\"list\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"claude-h\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <h2 id=\"claude-h\">Connect Claude.<span class=\"soft\">Make forms straight from the builder.</span></h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Add this app as a connector in Claude once. The MCQ Form Builder artifact then makes the Google Form for you with one click, and every form shows up above.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"linkrow\">\n        <div class=\"linkrow-text\">\n          <span class=\"linkrow-label\">Connector URL</span>\n          <code class=\"linkrow-url\" id=\"mcp-url\"></code>\n          <span class=\"linkrow-hint\">Paste this when Claude asks for the server URL.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"linkrow-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"mcp-copy\" type=\"button\">Copy</button></div>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"steps\">\n        <li><span>In Claude, open <b>Settings</b>, then <b>Connectors</b>, and choose <b>Add custom connector</b>.</span></li>\n        <li><span>Name it <code>MCQ Form Builder</code> exactly, so the builder can find it, and paste the URL above.</span></li>\n        <li><span>Click <b>Connect</b>, sign in with this Google account and choose <b>Allow</b>.</span></li>\n        <li><span>Open the MCQ Form Builder and press <b>Make the Google Form</b>.</span></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3 class=\"card-title\">Connected apps</h3>\n      <div class=\"tokens\" id=\"connections\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"api-h\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <h2 id=\"api-h\">Use the API.<span class=\"soft\">For scripts and other tools.</span></h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Anything that can send an HTTP request can post a form payload with an API token. Each request runs Apps Script as you and the form shows up above.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h3 class=\"card-title\">API tokens</h3>\n      <p class=\"card-sub\">A token acts as your Google account here. Keep it private and revoke it when you're done.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"token-name\">Token name</label><input id=\"token-name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"MCQ Form Builder artifact\" maxlength=\"60\"></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"token-create\" type=\"button\">Create token</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"secret panel\" id=\"secret\" hidden>\n        <span class=\"card-title\">Copy this token now. It won't be shown again.</span>\n        <code id=\"secret-value\"></code>\n        <div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"secret-copy\" type=\"button\">Copy token</button><button class=\"link\" id=\"secret-hide\" type=\"button\">Hide</button></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tokens\" id=\"tokens\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Make a form from the command line</h3>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-grey\" id=\"curl-copy\" type=\"button\">Copy</button>\n      </div>\n      <pre class=\"code\" id=\"curl\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Example request\"></pre>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>\n    <span>Removing a form here keeps it in Google Forms. Delete it there to remove it for good.</span>\n    <span>Response counts come from Google when you refresh.</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n<div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" hidden></div>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/assets/dashboard.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
